  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Person on the run is mapped to the central figure",
  "description": "The text 'when you got a warrant out for your arrest & you on the run.....' explicitly refers to 'you', which is analogically mapped onto the central visual entity, 'person'. The person's distressed expression and the act of checking their phone while applying makeup are used to visually represent the state of being 'on the run', creating a humorous juxtaposition between the flamboyant appearance and the serious situation. This mapping is central to the meme's intent, as it projects the textual 'you' onto the visual 'person' to create the comedic effect.",
